wechatauto-replica 1.2.8.0
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Source: https://pypi.org/project/wechatauto-replica/1.2.8.0/

The targeted key-extraction approach implemented in lib/host/cipherkey.js
(the "com.Tencent.WCDB.Config.Cipher" pointer-chain walk, the 32-byte XOR
mask used to decode the cipher-config blob, and the page-1 HMAC verification
scheme) was derived by studying wechatauto/db.py, specifically
_collect_key_candidates, _keys_from_candidates and _verify_enc_key.

No source code was copied. lib/host/cipherkey.js is an independent
implementation: the memory-reading layer is written in C# (invoked through
PowerShell Add-Type) rather than Python/ctypes, and key verification reuses
this project's own pre-existing crypto.js oracle. Only the algorithm,
structure offsets and constants are shared.

