----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope and compliance
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
This plugin reads only local databases belonging to the account signed in on
this machine, opens them read-only, never uploads data, and never modifies
the original WeChat database files. Key extraction reads process memory of
the locally running WeChat client owned by the current user.